date-released: "2026-09-18"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22836247
title: "monotile-ca: cellular automata on the hat and spectre aperiodic monotilings"
abstract: "Toolchain, search drivers, and the complete replayable result set behind 'Gliders on Aperiodic Monotilings: Cellular Automata on the Hat and Spectre' and its companion interactive essay: transducer-generated patches of the hat, spectre and Penrose tilings, a no_std graph cellular-automaton engine (native and WebAssembly), exhaustive and evolutionary rule-space search with structural anti-gaming controls, cross-radius verification, and a constant-memory sliding-window tracker."
